              <li>• <strong>上下文丟失</strong>：專案變大時丟失深層調用鏈與型別繼承。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>編譯失敗</strong>：產生不符合專案架構規範的寫法。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-indigo-950/30 p-6 rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/30\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-indigo-300 font-bold text-base mb-3\">JetBrains 獨家靜態分析解法</h3>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-slate-200\">\n              <li>• <strong>PSI 抽象語法樹預檢</strong>：AI 輸出前先經由 IDE 完成靜態檢查。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>Smart Debugging 診斷</strong>：直連 Debugger 擷取 Stack Trace 解決異常。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>一鍵生成 Git & Test</strong>：自動規範 Commit Message 並補全測試。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">原廠說明連結：</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/code-inspection.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">Code Inspection Engine 🔗</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/ai-assistant/ai-chat.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">JetBrains AI Chat Docs 🔗</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 3: 計費與模型優勢 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-3')\" class=\"p-6 sm:p-7 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/20 border border-pink-500/30 text-pink-400 font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            03\n          </span>\n          <div>\n     