xt-sm sm:text-base\">Gemini 1.5 Pro</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n              <div class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm\">JetBrains</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white font-black text-sm sm:text-base\">Mellum (自研)</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">原廠條款背書：</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/ai/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">JetBrains Supported LLMs 🔗</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-service/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">JetBrains AI Service Agreement 🔗</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 4: 帳務管理優勢 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-4')\" class=\"p-6 sm:p-7 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            04\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第四段：帳務管理優勢</span>\n       